  "contentHtml": "<p>원진아 선생님 아이디어를 이쌤 선생님께서 활용하여 결과물을 올려주셨습니다.<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/782\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/782</a>&#160; <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1338\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1338</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>두 분 선생님 아이디어 고대로 아이들에게 과제로 내주었습니다.&#160;</p><p>예상을 뛰어넘는 아이디어와 글에 너무 즐거웠습니다.</p><p>잘하는 모둠에게 상품증정한다고 했지만 그에 비해 너무 열심히 해줘서 오히려 미안합니다 ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>제가 원소기호 설명할 때 <br>금은 아우~좋아! (아우라의 어원)<br>남성은 male, 여성은 철이 필요해서 Female (문제적남자 랩몬), <br>Cu는 가지마세요, 구리니까요 (김유진 선생님)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이런거 설명할 때는 뭐에요~ 라더니만, 원소기호 글짓기 곳곳에 많이 썼네요! 즐겁게 봐주세요!<br><a href=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"원소기호글짓기!\" data-og-description=\"원소기호를 넣어서 재밌는 글짓기를 해보세요!\" data-og-host=\"sanbonmiddle.padlet.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb\" data-og-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/g2RjM/hyKhrRZ8ZO/LtFDnbnkLetRpMsCxVKymK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/2PhtA/hyKgPAeMHi/0InwNsZlGByd011bj7KsX1/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\"><a href=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/oc0jvutpto8kalyb\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/g2RjM/hyKhrRZ8ZO/LtFDnbnkLetRpMsCxVKymK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/2PhtA/hyKgPAeMHi/0InwNsZlGByd011bj7KsX1/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">원소기호글짓기!</p><p class=\"og-desc\">원소기호를 넣어서 재밌는 글짓기를 해보세요!</p><p class=\"og-host\">sanbonmiddle.padlet.org</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>아! 이것도요. 김정식샘 원소기호기억력게임! 4단계를 100점 맞아 버리는 어마한 아이들입니당<br><a href=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"원소기호기억력게임 도전! 인증샷\" data-og-description=\"내 도전중 최고 기록을 패들렛에 올려주세요!\" data-og-host=\"sanbonmiddle.padlet.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3\" data-og-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRdiJQ/hyKhugSvDW/e623H64KkYzgRumkUiXs71/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/jMd1N/hyKhqMkxBT/QouE44vGYWK3ZUUJKQ2VhK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\"><a href=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sanbonmiddle.padlet.org/shinyeon/biokxn5lz5j74uy3\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bRdiJQ/hyKhugSvDW/e623H64KkYzgRumkUiXs71/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/jMd1N/hyKhqMkxBT/QouE44vGYWK3ZUUJKQ2VhK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">원소기호기억력게임 도전! 인증샷</p><p class=\"og-desc\">내 도전중 최고 기록을 패들렛에 올려주세요!</p><p class=\"og-host\">sanbonmiddle.padlet.org</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
